 from a scrapyard in Vancouver to the Orthodox Jewish community of Bnei Brak and back to a decaying farm in rural Manitoba. Each discovery adds to the visual and narrative collage, building to a surprising and thought-provoking conclusion that invites us to explore our own personal stories.   ", "short_description": "Blood Relations is a whimsical VR documentary about an adopted child and a quest to solve an ancestral mystery."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Portrait1008x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "3185431641772787", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTRAIT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974676_3185431645106120_7305487962040821417_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T42Q974a1-UQ7kNvwFzW5un&_nc_oc=AdrP9W9Qy1kPylj5D3jWZ83DwIC5EX_M2gpX6Sw6MtwJYncxeeZdh7IFxtJdcbuhqHk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK1ae2YzAtX3xu1OmNoajONq0ErmxEf37p7tPy4skP_ZA&oe=6AA2CA41"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_TrCoverImage2560x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "2112431928963685", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974453_2112431932297018_1168886450594301820_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UQA7V6dB__MQ7kNvwESBsK3&_nc_oc=AdpXDwl03r5BW2cwETjnmKgkuq3kHS4PGCScGVSZGdB5HtLJv5JOJZrhOBuvvqjSw50&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLsw53jbbZtHHkUO-Aivtr4sgq_xfHKVz9-H_lTRV8RPw&oe=6AA29F66"}, {"file_name": "BloodRelations_KeyArt-Square1440x1440FRA_v01.png", "id": "1965493300326997", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75262745_1965493303660330_6562698748019357103_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gZ-Fwe_GUjUQ7kNvwFAvDql&_nc_oc=Ado3ucI2rzZ17a9l6BhVrOVwgH0gE4_NZA9QkBRzKEk9Ncp5Hqc8R9XUxKp1eTmcdwc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIMABqyNs8x4Q743QL2P2Sf1KYhhWeUvXcoIPgdZcGRTA&oe=6AA2A95C"}, {"fil